    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="30f3c0a6-9b77-5a06-9ce1-ad85055b4bc8" activityNameId="e1fa5504-c8c9-51d3-959e-72147ce0e74a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Insulation spiral-seam duct, rockwool, DN 400, 30 mm, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Insulation spiral-seam duct, rockwool, DN 400, 30 mm, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: ff4db2e1-9cff-366c-8d0d-58c7b8c36e70
Materials used for the production. Estimation of electricity use for the different production steps. Energy use for heating of the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for the Infrastructure of the Production site included.
Location: Data for production in Germany used.
Technology: Insulation made of rock wool with 0.2 mm aluminium foil cover. Protected with a net made of galvanised steel wire. Weight 3.3 kg/m
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and technical information of producer. Data of one common product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ff4db2e1-9cff-366c-8d0d-58c7b8c36e70.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
